dgcl_stage_duration_seconds{stage,doc_type}
dgcl_queue_oldest_age_seconds{queue}  ← #1 ALERT
dgcl_llm_cost_usd_total{model}
dgcl_checkpoint_verdict_total{checkpoint,verdict}

